cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use FSoilTH, cite the archived release and exact version used."
title: "FSoilTH: A Configurable Frozen-Soil Thermo-Hydrology Model"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Xu
    given-names: Pengfei
repository-code: "https://github.com/finnwindfly/FSoilTH"
url: "https://finnwindfly.github.io/FSoilTH/"
version: "0.1.0-dev"
date-released: "2026-08-11"
abstract: >-
  FSoilTH is a one-dimensional Fortran research model for coupled water and
  heat transport in seasonally frozen ground and permafrost. It is under
  active development and has not yet reached its first scientific release.
keywords:
  - frozen soil
  - permafrost
  - thermo-hydrology
  - freeze-thaw
  - Fortran
